---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How this website collects and handles the information you share through its forms."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-700">Website privacy practices</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-ink-700">
      <p>
        This policy explains how information you share through this website is handled.
        It applies to the website only. The privacy of your clinical records and care is
        governed separately by HIPAA and the practice's Notice of Privacy Practices,
        which I'll provide before treatment begins.
      </p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink-900">What this website collects</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          If you choose to use the contact or insurance-verification forms, I collect
          only the information you enter, such as your name, email, phone number,
          preferred contact method, insurance provider, and any message you write. The
          forms intentionally do <strong>not</strong> ask for sensitive medical details,
          member ID numbers, dates of birth, or Social Security numbers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink-900">How form submissions are handled</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Form submissions are delivered by a third-party form service (Web3Forms) and
          sent by email to me. Because this on-site form pathway is not a
          HIPAA-secured channel, please keep what you share general. I follow up
          privately through a secure, HIPAA-compliant email account to discuss anything
          personal and to verify insurance benefits.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink-900">How your information is used</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Information you submit is used only to respond to your inquiry, verify
          benefits if requested, and schedule services. It is not sold or shared for
          marketing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink-900">Analytics & cookies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This site aims to keep tracking to a minimum. If basic, privacy-respecting
          analytics are used, they are limited to understanding general site usage and
          are not used to identify you personally.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink-900">Not for emergencies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website is not monitored for emergencies and does not provide crisis
          services. If you are in crisis, call <a href="tel:911" class="underline">911</a>
          or call/text <a href="tel:988" class="underline">988</a>, or see my
          <a href="/crisis" class="underline">crisis resources</a>. Using this website
          does not create a therapist–client relationship.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink-900">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          For any questions about this policy, contact me at
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="underline">{site.email}</a> or
          <a href={site.phoneHref} class="underline">{site.phone}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
